N8RO AI Entity Commander
========================

A plugin for the N8RO simulation platform (Arkheon Technologies).

This repository contains only plugin source authored against the N8RO SDK. It
contains no Arkheon-shipped code: no SDK headers, no import libraries, no
platform binaries, no runtime data. Those remain in the licensed release tree
and are referenced at build time through the N8RO_RELEASE environment variable.

Provenance is recorded here rather than as a per-file header. Files in this
repository do not carry the Arkheon proprietary/confidential per-file banner;
that convention governs files inside the release tree itself.

Note on classification: this repository necessarily describes proprietary SDK
surface -- component type strings, schema field paths, and Lua verb signatures --
and docs/prd.md documents it in detail. Repository visibility is therefore the
control that governs disclosure. Default to private. Publication requires
explicit owner authorization.
